        "The record header shows name and ID, a status badge with text, at most four key fields and exactly one primary action": 100,
        "Secondary actions are grouped in an overflow menu": 0,
        "Content is organised in sections or tabs, not a long stack of unrelated cards": 50,
        "The activity history is a timeline with absolute timestamps (relative times only with the absolute value available)": 100,
        "The recent orders table right-aligns amounts and formats currency": 100,
        "Sections without data show an empty state with a next step": 0,
        "Avatars appear only for people; the company is shown with its logo or no image": 0,
