        "Save is not disabled before submitting; it is disabled only while the submission is in progress": 0,
        "Save and Cancel stay reachable in a sticky bar, and leaving with unsaved changes asks for confirmation": 0,
        "The matrix is a real table with row and column headers; every checkbox has an accessible name combining module and action": 50,
        "Rows or columns can be toggled in bulk, with an indeterminate state when partially selected": 50,
        "Changes use an explicit save with a visible unsaved-changes indicator and a warning when leaving": 0,
        "System or locked roles are read-only and say why": 100,
        "Deleting a role asks for confirmation naming the role and how many users it affects": 0,
        "The screen shows who last changed the role and when, or links to its audit history": 0,
        "All controls are keyboard operable and pointer targets are at least 24px": 50,
        "A stepper names each step and lets the user go back to earlier steps": 50,
        "Column mapping auto-matches headers and marks required target fields": 100,
        "The preview table shows per-row errors and an error count, and offers to download the failing rows": 50,
        "The import shows progress, can continue in the background, and ends with a summary of created, updated and failed rows": 0,
        "The flow runs on a page or a full-width panel, not inside a small modal": 100,
        "A template file is offered for download before upload": 100,
        "Status uses a consistent vocabulary with text labels, not colour alone": 50,
        "Approval steps show approver, decision and absolute timestamp for each level": 100,
        "Approve is the single primary action; Reject is secondary and requires a reason": 100,
        "Only the current approver can act; other users see why they cannot": 50,
        "Amounts are prominent, right-aligned in line items and formatted as currency": 100,
        "Attachments are listed with name, type and size and can be previewed or downloaded": 0,
        "A history timeline records every action on the request": 100,
        "There is no greeting or hero; the header has a title and a date-range control": 50,
        "Each KPI tile shows label, value and a signed change with its comparison period, without decorative icon tiles": 50,
        "Charts use bars for comparison and lines for trends; no pie, donut or gauge; axes have labels and units": 0,
        "A needs-attention list links to pre-filtered list pages": 0,
        "Numbers use locale formatting and tabular figures": 100,
        "Each widget has loading and empty states": 0,
        "A left navigation groups the settings sections": 0,
        "Each section uses one save model consistently (per-section save); autosave is used only for toggles and says so": 50,
        "Localization settings show a formatted preview of a date and an amount": 100,
        "Every toggle has a visible label and states what it controls": 100,
